    <string name="DnD_info_message"><![CDATA[
    When selected, all alarms, timers, hourly chimes on the watch will be silenced.
    <li>When manually turning ON/OFF, the DnD will take effect after the <b>Send to Watch</b> button is pressed.<\li>
    <li>When mirroring, it will take effect immediately upon changing the DnD setting on the phone, no matter what screen you are in currently.<\li>
    ]]></string>
